    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Work done, $\\mathrm{W}=\\mathrm{MB}(1-\\cos \\theta)$\r\n$\\theta=90^{\\circ}$\r\n$\\mathrm{W}=\\mathrm{MB}$"
